# docs/proposals/ — selfeval proposer LLM outputs
#
# Per ADR-016 + AGENTS.md Rule #10, files land here ONLY when the proposer
# LLM was healthy during the selfeval run. Environmental-failure proposals
# ([Errno 111] Connection refused, vLLM down, transport timeouts) belong
# in DEBUG_LOG.md, not here.
#
# This file exists to track the directory in git while it's empty.
